#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:17
#: 62cc04f8873d43908c9e4168db2d1de6
msgid ""
"Install through **fa-py-libraries** (Python 3.12 env). That repo’s "
"`./init.sh all` installs `ros2_robot_interface` among the other "
"submodules."
msgstr ""
"通过 **fa-py-libraries** 安装（Python 3.12 环境）。该仓库的 `./init.sh all` 会安装 "
"`ros2_robot_interface` 以及其他子模块。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:19
#: 688a3474c9d94595ab38c4c9940858ca
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:25
#: cacb680dfdbd4f649e94157c4bd0afa2
msgid ""
"Datagen / motion-queue path: from a **lerobot_ros2** checkout, `./init.sh"
" all-motion` (or `./init.sh all`) installs the same package as "
"`submodules/ros2_robot_interface`."
msgstr ""
"数据生成 / 运动队列路径：在 **lerobot_ros2** 检出中，`./init.sh all-motion`（或 `./init.sh "
"all`）会把同一包装成 `submodules/ros2_robot_interface`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:27
#: 114c633576304f09bd9f028ed85c88c9
msgid "Manual fallback"
msgstr "手动回退"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:30
#: 127a87761c99464784b852e76440f1f6
msgid ""
"Standalone clone of `ros2_robot_interface` and `pip install -e .` (inside"
" a project venv; `--no-deps` on uv so `rclpy` is not fetched from PyPI) "
"is only for package development outside those umbrellas. Do not treat "
"`pip install ros2-robot-interface` on system Python as the stack entry."
msgstr ""
"单独克隆 `ros2_robot_interface` 并 `pip install -e .`（在项目虚拟环境内；uv 加 `--no-"
"deps` 以免从 PyPI 拉 `rclpy`）只用于这些伞仓之外的包开发。不要把系统 Python 上的 `pip install ros2"
"-robot-interface` 当作本栈入口。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:33
#: 337cf66d0c934d69bd675b556308aaef
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:35
#: 14fde2691ac64e14975b4054d31751b5
msgid ""
"from ros2_robot_interface import RobotInterface\n"
"\n"
"robot = RobotInterface()\n"
"robot.connect()\n"
"\n"
"# Move joints\n"
"robot.move_j([0.0, -0.5, 0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 0.0])\n"
"\n"
"# Move Cartesian\n"
"robot.move_l([0.3, 0.0, 0.4], [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0])\n"
"\n"
"# Gripper\n"
"robot.gripper_open()\n"
"robot.gripper_close()\n"
msgstr ""
"from ros2_robot_interface import RobotInterface\n"
"\n"
"robot = RobotInterface()\n"
"robot.connect()\n"
"\n"
"# Move joints\n"
"robot.move_j([0.0, -0.5, 0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 0.0])\n"
"\n"
"# Move Cartesian\n"
"robot.move_l([0.3, 0.0, 0.4], [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0])\n"
"\n"
"# Gripper\n"
"robot.gripper_open()\n"
"robot.gripper_close()\n"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:52
